Dive into the mysterious depths of Glopbix! Raise, breed, and collect unique aquatic creatures in the most advanced virtual aquarium simulation.

With millions of possible genetic combinations, no two aquariums are ever the same. Discover rare species, decorate your tank, and play mini-games to become the ultimate Ocean Master!

🌟 KEY FEATURES
• 🧬 AI GENETICS ENGINE: Every fish has its own unique DNA. Breed your aquatic pets to discover infinite color combinations, patterns, and fin shapes powered by AI!
• 🐙 GLOOBY AI ASSISTANT: Meet Glooby, your smart in-game marine biologist. Ask questions about your tank, get care tips, and learn real science about marine life.
• 🌿 DYNAMIC ECOSYSTEM: Plant flora and place corals that actually affect your water quality. Balance your ecosystem to keep your fish happy!
• 🎣 OCEAN ADVENTURES: Take a break from the tank and play 4 exciting mini-games: Abyssal Hunt, Reef Rush, The Leviathan, and DNA Codex.
• 📱 OPTIMIZED FOR ALL DEVICES: Features a specialized "Low-End Mode" ensuring smooth gameplay on any device without draining your battery.
• 💧 INTERACTIVE CARE: Feed your pets, clean their habitat, and manage water temperature to unlock the rarest legendary species.

Can you unlock all 77 species and complete the Marine Encyclopedia? The ocean has no limits!
